  "notes": "{痛|いた}む is an intransitive verb meaning to feel pain or ache.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Related: ⟦{痛|いた}める→痛める：13613_itameru⟧ (transitive, to hurt/injure)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{痛|いた}む (head hurts)\n- ⟦{胃|い}→胃：01706_i⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{痛|いた}む (stomach hurts)\n- ⟦{傷|きず}→傷：02201_kizu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{痛|いた}む (wound hurts)\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{痛|いた}む (heart aches - figurative)\n\nDISTINCTION FROM ⟦{痛|いた}い→痛い：01108_itai⟧:\n- ⟦{痛|いた}い→痛い：01108_itai⟧: adjective describing pain sensation\n- {痛|いた}む: verb indicating ongoing/developing pain",
